flowchart LR
  subgraph AK[金山云星源 AgentKit 平台]
    direction TB
    AE[AgentEngine Serverless 运行时<br/>LangGraph / KSADK]
    SK[Skills 中心<br/>containerize-node/spring/go<br/>fix-ci-failure / security-review]
    KC[KCI 沙箱<br/>无凭据 · Provider 抽象层接入]
    TR[Trace 可观测]
  end

  subgraph TB[受信边界（自研）]
    direction TB
    MCP[MCP Server devops-broker<br/>协议外壳 · 无秘密]
    BR[Proposal Broker<br/>四动作白名单 + 策略管线<br/>哈希链审计 · GitHub App 身份]
    NT[notifier<br/>Webhook 校验与事件分发]
  end

  subgraph GH[GitHub]
    direction TB
    APP[应用仓库<br/>PR 审查 → main 可信构建<br/>GHCR digest 绑定]
    OPS[运维仓库<br/>发布请求 PR → release workflow<br/>Environment 人工审批]
  end

  subgraph PROD[生产主机]
    direction TB
    DEP[Deployer<br/>仅出站拉取 · manifest 全量校验]
    BG[蓝绿双槽位 :18080/:18081]
    CD[Caddy 切流/TLS/CORS 档位]
    SEC[/宿主受信 secret/]
    DB[(数据库)]
  end

  AE --> SK --> KC
  AE <--> MCP
  AE -. Trace .-> TR
  MCP <--> BR
  BR -->|agent/ 分支 + PR| APP
  APP -->|Webhook CI 结果| NT
  NT -->|唤醒自修| AE
  OPS -->|获批 manifest| DEP --> BG --> CD
  BG --> DB
  SEC --> BG
  DEP -->|告警| NT
  NT -->|值守 Agent| AK

  classDef platform fill:#e8f0fe,stroke:#4285f4
  classDef trusted fill:#e6f4ea,stroke:#34a853
  classDef prod fill:#fef7e0,stroke:#f9ab00
  class AK,AE,SK,KC,TR platform
  class TB,MCP,BR,NT trusted
  class PROD,DEP,BG,CD,SEC,DB prod
